<p>This is where I’ll be writing notes on math.</p>
<p>Math renders in the usual way — inline like <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?e%5E%7Bi%5Cpi%7D%20+%201%20=%200">, or set apart in display:</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?%0A%5Cint_%7B-%5Cinfty%7D%5E%7B%5Cinfty%7D%20e%5E%7B-x%5E2%7D%5C,dx%20=%20%5Csqrt%7B%5Cpi%7D.%0A"></p>
<p>See the <a href="../theorem-demo/">theorem demo</a> for theorem environments and a worked computation.</p>



